  unitName: Kelsa
  unitId: 850827
  unitNumber: 8620
  description: "Rooster had always been a fighter, not a lover. During her tenure
    as a celestial creature in the court of Heaven, she was known for her fiery temperament
    and a swaggering flair to match\u2014though her love for posturing has gotten
    her into more than a few scrapes and bruised egos. Nevertheless, Rooster had
    a good heart like all the rest, and the competition put out by Emperor Yu was
    one she dutifully joined.The lifeless concrete city she arrived at was nothing
    like the royal gardens of Heaven where she could strut to her heart's content.
    In fact, cramped and isolating as it was, Rooster felt suffocated. Was she, a
    once-renowned warrior of Heaven, now nothing more than a caged bird?As she wandered
    into a dark alley, Rooster's keen eyesight detected a strike from the shadows
    mere inches from her neck. The thugs were fierce, but they had no idea how wrong
    they were choosing to assault who they thought was a seemingly defenseless woman.
    With deft kicks and a killer backhand, Rooster floored them and sent them packing
    with tails tucked.Someone had to have seen the altercation, for she was approached
    by a hooded messenger, and Rooster found herself heading through winding tunnels
    smelling of salt and blood. Before long, she found its source: demarcated boundaries
    where two opponents pit their bodies and fists against each other. Asked if she
    would enter, Rooster knew she had a plan.No one knew where this \"Kelsa\" came
    from, and no one really cared. But one thing was certain: a new contender had
    walked the walk, and she was about to kick up a storm."
  summonDesc: What's up?<br>If you're here for the bout you're too early.<br>...But
    I can spare some time.
  fusionDesc: You didn't have to <br>go out of your way for this,<br>but thanks.
